== CORRECTION, 2026-10-21 (the repair-diff pass: Fable 5.1 and GPT-6 Astra; checked against RUNLOG.txt) ==
Line 9 above reads "the table's first build log 01:16:55".  01:16:55 is the CONFIGURE line (RUNLOG.txt:2, "SETUP
configure rc=0"); the table's first BUILD is 01:17:37 (RUNLOG.txt:3, "BUILD HEAD").  PRETABLE2.out (01:15:27) still
precedes both, so the order claim holds.  Also: PRETABLE2.out:72's prose "the 20 population rows die on HEAD" omits the
four rows revision 3 added, which its own :236 includes; the machine-readable prediction (PRETABLE2_predictions.json)
carried all 24 and MATCHED.  PRETABLE2.out is deliberately NOT edited -- its mtime is the order proof.
